1d:T860,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Apakah ada Minecraft gratis yang resmi untuk Android?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Tidak ada versi penuh gratis yang resmi. Yang resmi dan gratis hanyalah Minecraft Trial - versi percobaan terbatas dari Mojang di Play Store. Semua situs yang menawarkan Minecraft APK penuh gratis membagikan bajakan atau penipuan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Berapa harga Minecraft Android?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Harga resmi satu kali beli tercantum di halaman Play Store-nya untuk Indonesia dan dapat berubah saat promo resmi. Cek angka terkininya lewat tombol resmi di halaman ini - kami tidak mencetak angka yang bisa kedaluwarsa dan menyesatkanmu."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Kalau sudah beli, apakah bisa dipasang di HP baru tanpa bayar lagi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Bisa. Pembelian terikat pada akun Google yang dipakai membeli. Masuk dengan akun yang sama di HP baru, buka halaman Minecraft di Play Store, dan kamu bisa memasangnya kembali tanpa membeli ulang."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Apa beda Minecraft dan Minecraft Trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Trial adalah demo resmi gratis: mode survival dengan batas waktu dan tanpa fitur penuh seperti multipemain bebas dan penyimpanan dunia jangka panjang. Game penuh membuka semua mode, dunia tanpa batas waktu, dan fitur daring resmi."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Apakah Minecraft bisa dimainkan offline?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Mode pemain tunggal bisa dimainkan offline setelah game terpasang dan terverifikasi. Fitur daring seperti Realms, Marketplace, dan multipemain internet tetap butuh koneksi."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Anak saya menemukan situs Minecraft gratis, apa yang harus dilakukan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jangan diunduh. Jelaskan bahwa versi itu bajakan dan sering membawa virus serta iklan tidak pantas, lalu gunakan Minecraft Trial resmi untuk mencoba. Bila keluarga memutuskan membeli, lakukan dari Play Store dengan akun keluarga agar tercatat dan aman."}}]}13:["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8 py-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Beranda\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Aplikasi\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/aplikasi\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Minecraft\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/aplikasi/minecraft\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1d"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Minecraft\",\"applicationCategory\":\"GameApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Android\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Mojang (Microsoft)\"},\"url\":\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mojang.minecraftpe\",\"inLanguage\":\"id-ID\"}"}}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"text-sm text-ink/60","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1","children":[["$","li","/",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[false,["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-primary-dark","children":"Beranda"}]]}],"$L1e","$L1f"]}]}],"$L20","$L21",false,"$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25",null,"$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32"]}]
